    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i dont really wanna go to the doctor right now if i can help it... it doesnt even hurt that bad, just feels heavy and a bit tight. do u think it could just be from the new shoes i was wearing? if it's just inflammation, can i just take some ibuprofen and be done with it?",
